      "description": "Player has mined at least one lime_stained_glass block and collected it",
      "rules": [
        {
          "rule_type": "inventory_has",
          "parameters": {
            "item": "lime_stained_glass",
            "quantity": 1
          },
          "description": "Player has at least 1 lime_stained_glass in inventory (requires Silk Touch pickaxe)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

### Notes for Validator:
- The `position_inside_box` for "find lapis_block" uses relative coordinates (~2 to ~8 on X and Z) which creates a 6x6 box around the lapis pillar at ~5,~5. The player must walk into this area to "find" the landmark.
- The `inventory_has` for "mine lime_stained_glass" requires the Silk Touch fix from CommonSenseAgent. Without it, this milestone is impossible.
- The Y range (~-1 to ~5) accounts for the player standing on the grass floor (y=~0) near the 4-block-tall pillar.

